window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They say I'm the key to everything, the Aether Gate, the end of the world, the beginning of something new.</b></p> <p>But I don't remember any of it.</p> <p>Not the power I once held.</p> <p>Not the men fate bound me to across lifetimes.</p> <p>Not why the Luminous are hunting me like I already belong to them.</p> <p>All I have are fractured memories, a broken past, and four dangerous warriors who claim to be mine. Death, War, Famine, and Pestilence—the Horsemen who burn for me, bleed for me, and would tear the world apart to protect me.</p> <p>The gates are awakening. The Luminous want to control them, and if they do, they'll rewrite existence itself. Every world. Every life. Every timeline.</p> <p>To stop them, I'll have to become what I was before.</p> <p>Even if I don't remember how.</p> <p>Even if it destroys me.</p> <p>Because loving them might not be enough to save the world.</p> <p>But it's the only thing that's ever saved me.</p>"; 
